Flagstaff Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2110 UTC Friday, August  8, 2025



.AVIATION...Friday 08/18Z through Saturday 09/18Z...Expect VFR

conditions with localized areas of haze/smoke north of a KGCN- 

KPGA line and south of a KPAN-KSOW line. Look for southwest winds

10-20 kts gusting to 30 kts into the early evening. Isolated 

-SHRA/-TSRA along and south of a KPAN-KSJN line, where dry 

 lightning and gusty/erratic winds will be the main hazards. Light

 and variable winds return by 03Z. 

OUTLOOK...Saturday 09/18Z through Monday 11/18Z...Expect VFR

conditions with localized areas of haze/smoke north of a KGCN- 

KPGA line and south of a KPAN-KSOW line. Look for daily chances 

for -SHRA/-TSRA, primarily across the higher terrain between 

18Z-03Z. Outside of storm driven winds, expect west to southwest 

winds 5-15 kts gusting up to 25 kts. Light and variable winds 

should return during the overnight periods.





