Coastal Waters Forecast for North Carolina

National Weather Service Newport/Morehead City NC

636 PM EDT Fri Aug 8 2025



From S of Currituck Beach Light to N of Surf City NC out 20 NM,

including the Albemarle and Pamlico Sounds and the Monitor

National Marine Sanctuary



AMZ100-091145-

636 PM EDT Fri Aug 8 2025



.Synopsis for Eastern North Carolina coastal waters...

An area of weak troughing will linger along the Southeast coast 

late week and into the weekend as a wave of low pressure drifts

well to the east over the open Atlantic, bringing the potential 

for hazardous marine conditions.



