FWSSTO



Spot Forecast for Tiger Fire...CAL FIRE

National Weather Service Sacramento CA

339 PM PDT Fri Aug 8 2025



Forecast is based on forecast start time of 1800 PDT on August 08. 

If conditions become unrepresentative...contact the National Weather

Service.



.DISCUSSION...

A hot and dry airmass will bring above normal temperatures, low 

daytime humidity, and moderate overnight recoveries to the Tiger 

Fire vicinity through the weekend. Periodically breezy winds 

expected, with a west-southwest direction midday into the early 

evening shifting to an east-northeast direction overnight. A 

cooling trend is then anticipated from Tuesday onward, although 

dry weather looks to continue. 



.TONIGHT...



