642 PM EDT Fri Aug 8 2025



Surf City NC to South Santee River SC out 20 NM



AMZ200-091115-

642 PM EDT Fri Aug 8 2025



.Synopsis for coastal waters from Surf City North Carolina to 

South Santee River South Carolina out to 20 nautical miles...

Northeasterly winds will prevail across the local coastal waters 

through this weekend. With a wedge of high pressure inland and 

weak low pressure offshore, scattered showers and thunderstorms 

will occasionally impact the waters through Monday. High pressure

shifts south by early next week leading to lighter winds.



