Pueblo Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2009 UTC Friday, August  8, 2025



.AVIATION /18Z TAFS THROUGH 18Z SATURDAY/...

Issued at 1131 AM MDT Fri Aug 8 2025

Main concern this fcst period will be a cold front moving across

KCOS and KPUB later this evening. Prefrontal trough will move

across KCOS around 03 UTC with fropa around 05 UTC. Gusty north

winds will then occur, gradually becoming easterly during the

early AM hours of Saturday. South-southeasterly winds will occur

by later tomorrow morning. 

At KPUB, Prefrontal winds will develop around 01 UTC with the

northerly surge pushing across late this evening around 07 UTC.

Winds may be quite gusty during the early AM hours before

becoming easterly by sunrise, the southeasterly by mid morning. 

KALS will be VFR next 24 hours with light winds. 





