Including the Communities of Key West

655 PM EDT Fri Aug 8 2025



.NOW...

Through 800 pm, scattered showers with embedded thunderstorms will 

move north to northwest at near 10 knots through the outer Gulf 

waters, the Florida Straits south of the Lower Keys, and the waters 

surrounding the Florida Keys. Mariners encountering the heaviest 

activity, located south of Cosgrove Shoal Light, may observe moderate

to heavy downpours reducing visbilities, wind gusts of near 25 

knots, and occasional lightning strikes.



