National Weather Service Wakefield VA

657 PM EDT Fri Aug 8 2025



Virginia Portion of the Chesapeake Bay, Currituck Sound and

Atlantic Coastal Waters from Fenwick Island DE to Currituck Beach

Light NC out 20 nautical miles



ANZ600-091115-

657 PM EDT Fri Aug 8 2025



.Synopsis for Fenwick Island DE to Currituck Beach Light NC out 20 

nautical miles including Virginia portion of the Chesapeake Bay, 

Currituck Sound and portions of the James, York, and Rappahannock 

Rivers...



High pressure remains anchored off the New England coast tonight

and Saturday as low pressure lifts northeast well off the North

Carolina coast. This will result in persistent onshore flow and 

elevated seas. Conditions gradually improve later this weekend. 

Benign marine conditions are expected from the early to middle 

part of next week.



