Spot Forecast for CA-SHF Green Fire...Shasta Trinity National Forest

National Weather Service Sacramento CA

402 PM PDT Fri Aug 8 2025



Forecast is based on forecast start time of 1700 PDT on August 08. 

If conditions become unrepresentative...contact the National Weather

Service.



...Hot Temperatures and Low Relative Humidity through Sunday...



.DISCUSSION...

A hot and dry airmass will bring above normal temperatures, low 

daytime humidity, and poor overnight recoveries in the vicinity of

the Green Fire through this weekend. Winds expected to follow 

diurnal trends, with north-northeast gusts 15 to 20 mph late 

evening and overnight, tapering off by late morning. A cooling 

trend is anticipated from Tuesday onward, although dry weather 

looks to continue. 



