.Synopsis for Stonington ME to Merrimack River Ma out to 25 NM 

Our weather remains in the grips of high pressure through the

weekend. Sea breezes remain the dominant wind pattern each afternoon

until southwest winds start to increase on Saturday. Overall winds

and expected to remain light with seas below 5 feet.



